00:05:10,434 --> 00:05:16,434
Survival Is His Revenge

2
00:10:20,869 --> 00:10:26,869
Riddick is a science fiction, action, thriller film directed by David Twohy.

3
00:15:31,304 --> 00:15:37,304
Betrayed by his own kind and left for dead on a desolate planet, Riddick fights for survival
against alien predators and becomes more powerful and dangerous than ever before.

4
00:20:41,739 --> 00:20:47,739
Soon bounty hunters from throughout the galaxy descend on Riddick only to
find themselves pawns in his greater scheme for revenge.

5
00:25:52,173 --> 00:25:58,173
With his enemies right where he wants them, Riddick unleashes a vicious attack of vengeance
before returning to his home planet of Furya to save it from destruction.

6
