01:02:05,217 --> 01:02:11,217
Riddick is a 2013 science fiction action film written and directed
by David Twohy, based on the character Richard B.

13
01:07:15,652 --> 01:07:21,652
Riddick by Jim and Ken Wheat.

14
01:12:26,086 --> 01:12:32,086
It is the third installment in The Chronicles of Riddick film series and a sequel
to both Pitch Black (2000) and The Chronicles of Riddick (2004).

15
01:17:36,521 --> 01:17:42,521
Vin Diesel reprises his role as the titular character alongside Jordi Mollà, Matt Nable,
Katee Sackhoff, Dave Bautista, Bokeem Woodbine, Raoul Trujillo, and Karl Urban.

16
01:22:46,956 --> 01:22:52,956
In the film, notorious murderer Riddick is betrayed and left for dead
on a desolate planet and uses his instincts to survive.

17
01:27:57,391 --> 01:28:03,391
He eventually teams up with mercenaries arriving to
capture him to escape from a larger threat.

18
01:33:07,826 --> 01:33:13,826
Riddick was released in the United States on September 6, 2013.

19
01:38:18,260 --> 01:38:24,260
Critics considered it a return to form for the series and it became a
moderate box-office success compared to its predecessor.

20
01:43:28,695 --> 01:43:34,695
A fourth film, entitled Riddick: Furya, is in development.

21
01:48:39,130 --> 01:48:45,130
The film explores themes of dystopia, mercenary, sequel, alien, revenge.

22
01:53:49,565 --> 01:53:55,565
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
